  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">3A W/C Africa Air Transport Phase II-B</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project Development Objectives are as follows: (i) improve national Civil Aviation Authorities&apos; (CAAs&apos;) compliance with International Civil Aviation Organization&apos;s (ICAO&apos;s) safety standards, (ii) increase national CAA&apos;s compliance with ICAO&apos;s security standards, and (iii) enhance main international airports&apos; compliance with ICAO&apos;s securtity standards.</narrative>
  </description>
